WEBVTT

00:00:05.967 --> 00:00:10.825
So actually we bow
to innocence within us.

00:00:15.639 --> 00:00:20.790
And this innocence is the one

00:00:21.812 --> 00:00:25.002
gives you the enlightenment.

00:00:29.019 --> 00:00:34.117
As I told you yesterday,
the light has innocence.

00:00:37.027 --> 00:00:42.325
But this is innocent without knowledge.

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:51.467
But your light is innocent
with knowledge.

00:00:52.908 --> 00:00:58.903
We always think that the people who have
got knowledge can never be innocent,

00:00:59.816 --> 00:01:02.199
can never be simple.

00:01:02.452 --> 00:01:05.509
And the idea we have got about innocence is

00:01:05.589 --> 00:01:09.533
that an innocent person is always deceived,

00:01:10.666 --> 00:01:16.806
can be befooled, and
can be always taken for granted.

00:01:20.303 --> 00:01:23.149
But innocence is a power.

00:01:24.274 --> 00:01:28.878
It is a power which protects you,

00:01:31.114 --> 00:01:34.968
which gives you light of knowledge.

00:01:35.638 --> 00:01:43.984
Knowledge that we have in the worldly
sense is how to exploit others,

00:01:44.446 --> 00:01:49.509
how to cheat others, how to make money
out of them,

00:01:50.933 --> 00:01:57.059
how to make fun of others,
how to look down upon others.

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:05.813
But the light of innocence is the light

00:02:05.893 --> 00:02:11.113
by which you know that
love is the highest thing.

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:17.227
And it teaches you how to love others,

00:02:17.827 --> 00:02:23.786
how to care for others,
how to be gentle about others.

00:02:24.891 --> 00:02:27.691
It also gives you the light within.

00:02:27.771 --> 00:02:32.896
It's just the other way round of this
avidya that we have in this world.

00:02:32.976 --> 00:02:35.832
Just the other way round.

00:02:36.012 --> 00:02:41.576
The avidya outside teaches us competition,

00:02:44.587 --> 00:02:48.705
how to put the other person down,

00:02:51.137 --> 00:02:54.470
because it has fear.

00:02:56.166 --> 00:02:58.154
It is insecured.

00:02:58.234 --> 00:03:01.746
This knowledge is not secure at all.

00:03:04.373 --> 00:03:08.962
If it had security it would not
have behaved like this.

00:03:11.281 --> 00:03:16.380
But the light of innocence knows everything.

00:03:19.723 --> 00:03:21.549
It has no fear.

00:03:23.759 --> 00:03:26.883
When we say children are innocent,

00:03:26.963 --> 00:03:31.488
we mean to say that they have
that power of innocence.

00:03:31.568 --> 00:03:36.026
Many times people have noticed
if a child falls from a height

00:03:36.106 --> 00:03:44.800
he doesn't die, while a young man
may die with a much smaller height.

00:03:45.709 --> 00:03:49.039
And the child is not afraid while falling.

00:03:49.119 --> 00:03:55.995
He just enjoys as if there's
a parachute coming down nicely.

00:03:58.586 --> 00:04:03.620
And then when he falls down also, just
gets up, laughs, smiles at everyone.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:08.007
He doesn't understand
why everybody is worried.

00:04:08.605 --> 00:04:12.795
Because in that innocence he knows
that he's looked after.

00:04:13.588 --> 00:04:15.832
He's protected.

00:04:15.912 --> 00:04:22.305
He knows that there is a power which
is much higher than him,

00:04:22.385 --> 00:04:24.847
and he does not have to worry.

00:04:24.927 --> 00:04:29.801
Then we start putting ideas into
the head of the child,

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:36.346
and that is how he starts losing
his power of innocence

00:04:38.435 --> 00:04:41.092
and he becomes a coward.

00:04:42.272 --> 00:04:45.446
He becomes a cunning fellow.

00:04:45.575 --> 00:04:49.702
He becomes an unrighteous personality.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:57.966
But still we would say that the
innocence of children

00:04:58.046 --> 00:05:02.798
is innocence of ignorance

00:05:03.577 --> 00:05:05.186
in a way,

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:11.372
because they do not know the
dangers of life.

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:17.126
But the light of innocence knows
all the dangers,

00:05:19.576 --> 00:05:23.302
and also knows how to get rid of it.

00:05:24.573 --> 00:05:29.135
Also knows how to be away from
such a question.

00:05:33.421 --> 00:05:42.285
There was a wise man who was
going on a staircase.

00:05:42.365 --> 00:05:47.867
And there was a stupid man coming from
the other side. Foolish man.

00:05:47.947 --> 00:05:52.554
So foolish people are always aggressive,
that is one of the signs,

00:05:52.634 --> 00:05:56.044
because they have inferiority complex.

00:05:56.124 --> 00:06:00.336
So the foolish man says to the
man who was coming up,

00:06:00.416 --> 00:06:04.393
he says — one had to move on one side —

00:06:04.473 --> 00:06:10.915
so he says, "I don't move for fools."
The foolish one says.

00:06:12.694 --> 00:06:16.717
So the wise man says, "I do,"
and he moved.

00:06:25.742 --> 00:06:33.236
That's how the light of innocence
tells you how far to go with a person,

00:06:33.316 --> 00:06:35.184
how far to talk to a person,

00:06:36.319 --> 00:06:42.471
how far to indulge in another person's
personality or his problems.

00:06:42.638 --> 00:06:45.315
Otherwise he recedes.

00:06:45.395 --> 00:06:48.597
He understands that this gentleman
is a stupid fool,

00:06:48.677 --> 00:06:52.021
so I move for a fool like that.

00:06:52.101 --> 00:06:55.091
He doesn't pay attention
to such a person.

00:06:55.171 --> 00:06:58.461
He doesn't bother about such a person.

00:06:58.541 --> 00:07:03.345
This is the light of innocence which
gives you discrimination —

00:07:04.347 --> 00:07:06.606
how far to go with others.